
@startuml SS5_DuongDangKhoa_statechart
!theme plain
hide empty description

title State-chart Diagram for SS5 Charging Lifecycle

[*] --> WAITING : Phuong tien vao hang cho sac

state WAITING
state SCHEDULED
state CHARGING
state CHARGE_COMPLETED
state GRACE_PERIOD
state AVAILABLE
state OVERSTAY
state ERROR

WAITING --> SCHEDULED : He thong tinh do uu tien\nva lap lich sac
SCHEDULED --> CHARGING : Cong sac san sang\n[Khong vuot Peak Power Capping]
SCHEDULED --> WAITING : Chua the cap cong sac\n[Vuot gioi han cong suat]

CHARGING --> CHARGE_COMPLETED : SoC = 100%
CHARGING --> CHARGING : SoC >= 90%\n[Gui canh bao sac gan day]

CHARGE_COMPLETED --> GRACE_PERIOD : Gui thong bao hoan tat\nva bien nhan nang luong

GRACE_PERIOD --> AVAILABLE : Xe roi cong trong 15 phut
GRACE_PERIOD --> OVERSTAY : Het 15 phut an han\n[Xe van chiem cong]

OVERSTAY --> AVAILABLE : Xe roi cong sac\n[Da xu ly phi hoac ghi nhan no]

WAITING --> ERROR : Mat ket noi IoT
SCHEDULED --> ERROR : Loi he thong
CHARGING --> ERROR : Loi cong sac / Mat dien
GRACE_PERIOD --> ERROR : Loi IoT / Loi he thong

ERROR --> WAITING : Khoi phuc ket noi\n[Trang thai sac duoc xac nhan]
ERROR --> AVAILABLE : Khac phuc su co\n[Cong sac trong]

AVAILABLE --> [*]

@enduml
